(7655007, 1246326, 112739, '<td valign="top">I was practicing this very close type of winter photography last month. I love your composition and detail. The only thing is the snow is a little under exposed. I was practicing the correct settings to get snow to look like it actually is, white. I learned that an increase of at least 1.5 to 2 stops was needed to get the shutter speed right. The camera metering system wants to equal things out more. 9</td>', 'I was practicing this very close type of winter photography last month. I love your composition and detail. The only thing is the snow is a little under exposed. I was practicing the correct settings to get snow to look like it actually is, white. I learned that an increase of at least 1.5 to 2 stops was needed to get the shutter speed right. The camera metering system wants to equal things out more. 9', '2020-03-07 11:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
